<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS UNCH, FALLS TO $57-1/4 IN NY.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS UNCH, FALLS TO $57-1/4 IN NY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened unchanged at $57-5/8, but soon fell $0-3/8 to $57-1/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 296.80 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
